<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Images in HTML</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Working with Images in HTML</h1>

  <h2>My Favourite Nature Image</h2>
  <img
    src="https://picsum.photos/400/250"
    alt="A sample nature photograph"
    width="400"
  >

  <h2>About Images</h2>
  <p>HTML uses the img tag to display images on a web page.</p>
  <p>The alt attribute provides a text description of an image.</p>
</body>
</html>
